CORE libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++ --unwind 5 --no-unwinding-assertions
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^PARSING ERROR$
libc++-20 headers use SIMD intrinsics (__algorithm/simd_utils.h)
that CBMC's parser cannot handle. This test documents the
incompatibility with libc++-20 (LLVM 20, e.g., ubuntu 25.04).
Tests pass with libc++-18 (LLVM 18, e.g., ubuntu 24.04).
